widget_text.hint_text:
[ Tijd/Datum ] {time:%H:%M} {time:tz=JST:%H:%M} {time:tz=UTC+9:%H:%M}
              {date:%Y.%m.%d} {weekday} {weekday:short}
[ Widgetgegevens ] {stopwatch:stopwatch_0} {countdown:countdown_0} {dday:dday_0}
[ D-Day ] {dday} (lokale D-Day-waarde van deze widget)
[ Appgegevens ] {task_count} {directive_count} {next_event} {custom_var}
[ Voorwaarden ] {if task_count > 0}Taken {task_count}{else}Geen{/if}
              {if countdown:countdown_0 < 1h}Deadline nadert{else}Genoeg tijd{/if}

widget_text.template_help:
Inline style: {value|size=36|bold|italic|color=#ff4da6}
Line break: \n bijv. {time:%H:%M|size=36|bold}\n{date|size=12|color=#8090b0}
